{"seq":1,"slug":"path-smoothing-following","title":"路径平滑与跟随","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/path-smoothing-following","wordCount":1502,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"路径平滑与跟随\">路径平滑与跟随</h1><p>寻路算法交付的成果是一串路点——栅格 A* 给的是锯齿状的格子中心序列，navmesh 漏斗给的是贴边的折线拐点。这两种都不能直接喂给角色让它&quot;瞬移到下一个点再瞬移到下下个点&quot;。从一串静态坐标到角色每一帧平滑、自然的位移之间，差着两道工序：把路径本身变顺（平滑），以及让角色优雅地沿着它走（跟随）。这一篇专讲这两道工序，它衔接在<a href=\"../navigation-meshes/navmesh-funnel-pathfinding\">漏斗算法</a>之后、<a href=\"steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a>之前，是路径与运动之间的过渡层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>平滑与跟随解决的是两个正交的问题：平滑改的是&quot;路径这条线本身的形状&quot;，跟随改的是&quot;角色相对这条线怎么运动&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[寻路输出: 路点序列] --&gt; B[去冗余: 射线检测裁直&lt;br/&gt;能直达就跳过中间点]&#10;    B --&gt; C[平滑: 样条/圆角&lt;br/&gt;Catmull-Rom / 贝塞尔]&#10;    C --&gt; D[路径跟随]&#10;    D --&gt; E[前瞻点 lookahead&lt;br/&gt;沿路径取角色前方一点]&#10;    E --&gt; F[交给转向: seek/arrive 该点]&#10;    F --&gt; G{接近路径末端?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[arrive 减速停在终点]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[寻路输出: 路点序列] --&gt; B[去冗余: 射线检测裁直&lt;br/&gt;能直达就跳过中间点]\n    B --&gt; C[平滑: 样条/圆角&lt;br/&gt;Catmull-Rom / 贝塞尔]\n    C --&gt; D[路径跟随]\n    D --&gt; E[前瞻点 lookahead&lt;br/&gt;沿路径取角色前方一点]\n    E --&gt; F[交给转向: seek/arrive 该点]\n    F --&gt; G{接近路径末端?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[arrive 减速停在终点]\n    G --&gt;|否| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>解决的毛病</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n<th>副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去冗余裁直</td>\n<td>路点过密、无谓拐折</td>\n<td>射线/视线检测（line-of-sight）跳点</td>\n<td>需可见性查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样条平滑</td>\n<td>拐角生硬</td>\n<td>Catmull-Rom、贝塞尔、圆弧倒角</td>\n<td>略偏离最短路，可能蹭墙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前瞻跟随</td>\n<td>角色卡在路点上抖动</td>\n<td>lookahead 前瞻点</td>\n<td>前瞻太远会切角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终点处理</td>\n<td>冲过头、急停</td>\n<td>arrive 行为减速</td>\n<td>需减速半径调参</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路径去冗余与裁直\">路径去冗余与裁直</h2><p>栅格 A* 的路径常常一格一个点，而其中很多点是共线或可以直接跨越的——保留它们只会让角色走出阶梯状的细碎拐折。裁直（string pulling 的栅格版）的思路很简单：从当前锚点出发，不断尝试用一条直线连向后面更远的路点，只要这条直线不穿过任何障碍（用射线/视线检测验证），就跳过中间所有点；一旦某个更远点的直线被障碍挡住，就把上一个可达点钉为新锚点，从它继续。</p>\n<p>这等价于在栅格上做漏斗算法没做的&quot;拉直&quot;。navmesh 路径因为已经过<a href=\"../navigation-meshes/navmesh-funnel-pathfinding\">漏斗算法</a>处理，本身就是最短折线、无需再裁直——这也是 navmesh 相比栅格的一大优势。裁直之后路径点数大减，平滑和跟随都更轻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样条平滑-让拐角圆起来\">样条平滑：让拐角圆起来</h2><p>裁直后的路径仍是硬转角的折线，角色严格沿它走会在拐点处瞬间改向，看起来很机械。样条平滑用一条连续曲线穿过（或逼近）路点，把硬角变成圆弧。</p>\n<p>Catmull-Rom 样条特别适合路径平滑，因为它插值——曲线严格穿过每个控制点（路点），不会因为平滑而偏离原路点太远。给定相邻四个控制点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0,P_1,P_2,P_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 段上的点为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(t)=\\tfrac12\\big[(2P_1)+(-P_0+P_2)t+(2P_0-5P_1+4P_2-P_3)t^2+(-P_0+3P_1-3P_2+P_3)t^3\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></spa