ss=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>贝塞尔曲线则常用于只需在拐角处做局部倒角的场景：在拐点两侧各取一个控制点，用二次贝塞尔把尖角替换成一段圆滑弧。无论哪种，平滑都有一个必须警惕的副作用——曲线可能向拐角内侧凸出而蹭进墙里（尤其紧贴墙的漏斗路径）。常见对策是限制平滑幅度、或对平滑后的曲线再做一次贴墙检测把越界段拉回。要记住：平滑是表现层的美化，它本就允许略微偏离最短路，但不能偏到穿墙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路径跟随-前瞻点与终点处理\">路径跟随：前瞻点与终点处理</h2><p>有了平滑路径，怎么让角色沿它走？最朴素的&quot;逐点 seek&quot;——朝当前目标路点直冲、到了再换下一个——会在路点附近反复过冲、抖动，且转弯生硬。工业做法是前瞻点（lookahead / carrot）跟随：在路径上、角色当前位置的前方一小段距离处取一个点（像驴子前面吊的胡萝卜），让角色始终用 seek 朝这个不断前移的前瞻点移动。前瞻点随角色推进沿路径滑动，角色便平滑地&quot;被牵着&quot;走完全程，自然地切过拐角而不卡顿。</p>\n<p>前瞻距离是关键调参：太短，角色贴着路径走但转弯不够提前、易过冲；太长，角色会大幅切角、在急转处直接抄近道偏离路径甚至蹭墙。常按角色速度动态调整——速度快则前瞻远，留足转弯余量。</p>\n<p>终点要特殊处理：用前瞻点跟随时，角色接近路径末端会因为前瞻点&quot;撞到终点不动了&quot;而以全速冲向终点、过冲或急停。解法是切换到 arrive 行为——在距终点一个减速半径内，按到终点的距离线性（或平滑）降低期望速度，让角色优雅地减速停稳。这个 seek / arrive 的具体公式属于下一篇<a href=\"steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a>，这里只需知道：跟随的&quot;朝哪走&quot;由前瞻点给出，&quot;走多快、怎么停&quot;由转向行为执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>寻路输出的路点不能直接用，需经&quot;平滑路径形状 + 跟随角色运动&quot;两道正交工序。</li>\n<li>栅格路径先做射线裁直去冗余（栅格版拉绳）；navmesh 路径已被漏斗拉直，无需再裁。</li>\n<li>样条平滑把硬拐角变圆：Catmull-Rom 插值穿过路点、贝塞尔做局部倒角；务必防曲线内凸蹭墙。</li>\n<li>路径跟随用前瞻点（carrot）牵引角色平滑切角，前瞻距离按速度调；接近终点切 arrive 行为减速停稳。</li>\n<li>平滑是表现层美化（允许略偏最短但不可穿墙），与漏斗的&quot;求最短&quot;职责分明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>站内前置：<a href=\"../navigation-meshes/navmesh-funnel-pathfinding\">网格寻路与漏斗算法</a> —— 平滑的输入折线从哪来。</li>\n<li>站内进阶：<a href=\"steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a> —— seek/arrive 等具体跟随公式。</li>\n<li>站内进阶：<a href=\"local-avoidance-rvo\">局部避让 RVO/ORCA</a> —— 跟随期间如何不撞别的角色。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-ai/npc-behavior/steering-behaviors\">游戏 AI · 转向行为</a> —— 决策层视角的移动行为。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/procedural-animation\">动画系统 · 程序化动画</a> —— 平滑移动如何驱动脚步与转身动画。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路径平滑与跟随","id":"路径平滑与跟随"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"路径去冗余与裁直","id":"路径去冗余与裁直"},{"level":2,"text":"样条平滑：让拐角圆起来","id":"样条平滑-让拐角圆起来"},{"level":2,"text":"路径跟随：前瞻点与终点处理","id":"路径跟随-前瞻点与终点处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"动态障碍与重规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/dynamic-obstacles-replan"},"next":{"title":"转向行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/steering-behaviors"}}